}

ForceInfo0
{
	ForceToReplace FP_SEE
	Icon	"gfx/forcepowers/radar"
	ForcePowerName "Scanner"
	StartSound "sound/ambience/kotor/consolebeep03.mp3"
	LoopSound "sound/ambience/cp_02_lp.wav"
}

description	"Renegade Squadron: Sniper

Weaponry:
DL-44 Modified (Increased fire rate)
DLT20 Modified (Amban based, secondary fire only) 
3 Poison Darts ^3CS3^7
Portable Shockfield (for 15 seconds only) ^3CS4^7
Cloak
Scanner

Attributes:
Dodge 1 ^3CS1^7
Dash 1 ^3CS2^7
Invisible to Force Sense

The Renegade Squadron was a Rebel Alliance military unit of pirates, smugglers, and other types of fringers assembled and commanded by Col Serra at Han Solo's request. The unit consisted of underworlders recruited by Serra from around the galaxy."


